    "why_this_matters": "the taxonomy is only about the frozen corpus if it is reading the same bytes the frozen corpus was scored on. The extracted-code sha is checked per candidate and the detector's verdict is re-derived; a disagreement here would mean the detector changed under the record, not that the corpus did."
